# Gmail、NCBI API Key、轮询间隔现在都在网页的「设置 Settings」页面里配置和保存（加密存进本地数据库），
# 不再需要编辑这个文件。这个文件只在"从旧版升级"时作为一次性迁移来源被读取一次。
#
# Gmail, the NCBI API Key, and the poll interval are now configured on the web "Settings" page
# and saved to the local database (encrypted at rest) — you no longer need to edit this file.
# It's only read once, as a one-time migration source, if you're upgrading from an older version.

GMAIL_ADDRESS=
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=
NCBI_API_KEY=
POLL_INTERVAL_HOURS=
